{
  "slug": "mypowers",
  "name": "Mypowers",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Zero-trust military-grade AI co-founder OS with progressive FULL/PARTIAL/BASIC security, Fortress Bible audit trail, and native hooks",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 skills**, **4 agents** and **1 command**.\n\n- **Skills** (8): `bridge-import` (Use when importing a chat decision artifact into the code workspace and the artifact must be verified before…), `compliance-reporter` (Use when summarizing posture, decisions, and attestation outputs into audit-friendly artifacts for reviewers or compliance stakeholders), `decision-weaver` (Use when comparing implementation options and choosing the simplest truthful path within the current tooling and posture constraints), `dynamic-skill-forge` (Use when a project needs narrow, repeatable helper skills derived from the Fortress Bible and the current implementation…), `fortress-lab` (Use when gathering project context, framing risks, and deciding which checks matter most before implementation begins), `orchestrator` (Use when coordinating the full mypowers forge flow across research, decision-making, scanning, attestation, and audit updates), `security-oracle` (Use when validating edits, imported artifacts, or forge outputs against the mypowers zero-trust contract and current local tooling…), `supply-chain` (Use when producing change-level provenance, attestation artifacts, or truthful supply-chain status for mypowers outputs)\n- **Agents** (4): `analyst-agent` (Use when gathering evidence, comparing options, and documenting constraints for mypowers work), `executor-agent` (Use when implementing the approved mypowers path with small, testable, verified changes), `security-auditor-agent` (Use when reviewing mypowers work for zero-trust violations, unsupported claims, or missing safeguards), `visionary-agent` (Use when shaping truthful product direction, scope, and differentiation for mypowers decisions)\n- **Commands** (1): `claude`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mypowers@claude-community` from `poulrohan23/mypowers`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
